{"3958150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Park it at All Costs!", "steam_appid": 3958150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you park perfectly?</strong><br>Put your driving precision to the ultimate test in this fun and challenging car parking game. Navigate tight spaces, dodge obstacles, and master smooth, realistic driving controls as you guide your car into the perfect spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.mp4?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet suburban lots to busy city streets and multi-level garages, every level offers a new challenge that will test your steering skills and timing. Squeeze through narrow gaps, avoid collisions, and earn top scores for flawless parking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.mp4?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic car physics</strong> – Feel the weight, speed, and handling of your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of unique challenges</strong> – From simple to mind-bending parking puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied environments</strong> – Suburbs, downtown traffic, and complex garages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple camera angles</strong> – Find the perfect view for precise parking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; reward system</strong> – Get rewarded for accuracy and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick play sessions</strong> – Perfect for short breaks or long play marathons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a parking pro or just learning to steer, this game delivers a satisfying mix of skill, strategy, and fun — without the stress of real-world traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the <strong>king of car parking</strong>?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you park perfectly?</strong><br>Put your driving precision to the ultimate test in this fun and challenging car parking game. Navigate tight spaces, dodge obstacles, and master smooth, realistic driving controls as you guide your car into the perfect spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s